Rosemary runs macOS applications on other operating systems. This is the
build Ginrose ships: upstream Rosemary with fixes for Roblox on top that
have not reached an upstream release yet (FreeBSD kqueue filters, Objective-C
send cache, a Metal swapchain watchdog and floating dialogs on tiling
compositors, among others). It installs the same rosemary command as
emulators/rosemary, so only one of the two can be installed.
